  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: func go(s: URLSession, m: FileManager) { run { [s = m] in s.zap3() } } still yields swift:URLSession:0-0:zap3 (receiver_type_hint URLSession), same as the unshadowed control zap4. swift.py has no capture_list handling (grep capture_list: 0 hits); later swift.py commits (WI-sogof, 7b57c9137c) do not touch it. MECHANISM: swift binding pass records nothing for capture_list_item, so an initialised capture does not shadow."  # 2236
